<workout_file>
	<author>Jarvis Chau (via TrainingPeaks)</author>
	<name>8 x 2-Minute Power Intervals</name>
	<description>3 minutes easy pedaling
1 minute fast pedal (low resistance, fast as you can pedal without bouncing in the saddle)
1 minute easy pedaling
1 minute max effort (100+rpm)
1 minute easy pedaling
1 minute max effort (100+rpm)
2 minutes easy pedaling

8 x 2 minute @ VO2
2 minute recovery

10 minute cool down</description>
